tooltip_text = "Click a tile on the preview to pick it, or drag a rectangle to pick every
tile it touches. Clicking a tile that is already picked lets it go again.

Every tile is outlined, including the ones this has removed, so there is
always something to click.

Press H over the dock to show or hide the outlines."
